122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (The Headshot E-Sport Championship is a competitive gaming event organized by the Technology Subcommittee of the Student Union of the Faculty of Technology at the University of Sri Jayewardenepura. As part of Saviskara, the Technical Art Festival, Headshot unites e-sports enthusiasts, offering a platform for showcasing gaming talent, fostering teamwork, and building a stronger university community. This event emphasizes friendly competition and highlights the rising prominence of e-sports within a university setting, contributing to student growth beyond academics.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
