/P 79 0 R
/E (The University of Sri Jayewardenepura is a leading educational institution in Sri Lanka, celebrated for its academic excellence, cultural heritage, and commitment to innovation. It provides a vibrant learning environment across diverse faculties, fostering creativity, critical thinking, and leadership. The university encourages students to excel academically and explore personal and professional growth through extracurricular activities like Headshot and Saviskara.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
